{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近もキッチン用品売っているお店にいってきてお魚のソルトスプーンと、水色の綺麗なガラスのコップ買いました。(^_^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1A1Q5T3ZW3VRK4MZMAYTA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1A31GAPNFSMPJ2EB80Q24","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、本屋さんにもいって読んでる漫画の新しいのが出てたので買って。モンにも貸して。\n本屋さんでいろいろみて。\n目的なく、本屋さんにいる時間すっごい楽しいから好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あと抹茶のアイスも食べました。!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴロゴロだいすきだ〜。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1A5A0JGEG546M61AVJZ9M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1A9AH2VYZKNMF7BNH0MJ2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1AAG566GEKAZP01C00GXC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近い。(笑)\n買ってもらったムーミンのブランケットお気に入りです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね。!"}],"source":"archive"}